meta {
  name: 04 - Record Decision (GET fallback)
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/decisions/{{tenderId}}/{{decision}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Manual/fallback decision-recording path — same DecisionUpdater logic the real Slack button
  clicks use, reachable directly (e.g. a plain clickable link, or this request) without needing
  Slack interactivity configured at all.

  {{decision}} must be "bid" or "nobid" (case-insensitive per DecisionUpdater.ParseCanonicalDecision).
  {{tenderId}} must already have a TenderReviewRecord (went through a real Handoff) — 404
  otherwise.
}
